---
import Button from '../../ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="section_home-process">
          <div class="section-gap">
            <div class="container-main">
              <div class="home-process-wrapper">
                <div class="section-header is-center">
                  <div class="section-header-title-block is-center">
                    <div class="section-eyebrow">
                      <div class="section-eyebrow-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <path d="M10 0C10.75 6.25 13.75 9.25 20 10C13.75 10.75 10.75 13.75 10 20C9.25 13.75 6.25 10.75 0 10C6.25 9.25 9.25 6.25 10 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                      <div class="section-eyebrow-label">How We Work</div>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="heading-style-2 section-header-heading">A Clear Process for <span class="heading-accent">Meaningful<div class="heading-accent-line is-blue is-pos-process w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 270 18" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M4 9C70 5 160 4 266 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                            <path d="M44 15C120 11 200 10 246 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                          </svg></div></span> Progress</h2>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section-header-summary-block is-center">
                    <p class="text-size-regular">A typical engagement runs 8–16 weeks. Every phase ends with a decision, not just a document.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="home-process-content w-tabs">
                  <div class="home-process-tab-menu w-tab-menu">
                    <a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="home-process-tab is-active w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current">
                      <div>Discover</div>
                    </a>
                    <a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="home-process-tab w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                      <div>Analyze</div>
                    </a>
                    <a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="home-process-tab w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                      <div>Strategize</div>
                    </a>
                    <a data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="home-process-tab w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                      <div>Execute</div>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="home-process-panes w-tab-content">
                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active">
                      <div class="home-process-pane">
                        <div class="home-process-media"><img src="/images/home-process-team.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1098px) 100vw, 1098px" srcset="/images/home-process-team-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-team-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-team-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-team.webp 1098w" alt="Arcline consultants discussing a project around a laptop" class="home-process-image" />
                          <div class="home-process-note"><img src="/images/home-process-avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-process-avatar" />
                            <div class="home-process-note-card">
                              <div class="home-process-note-label">Arcline working principle</div>
                              <p class="text-size-regular">“We start with the business, not the framework.”</p>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-panel">
                          <div class="home-process-body">
                            <div class="home-process-step">Step 01 · Weeks 1–2</div>
                            <div class="home-process-text-block">
                              <div class="home-process-title-row">
                                <h3 class="heading-style-3">Discover</h3>
                                <div class="home-process-doodle w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 45 50" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M2 27C3.3557 18.4591 6.90298 10.3881 9 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M17.5 32C25.9926 27.1537 34.4984 22.3305 43 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M19.8228 47.1832C26.5813 47.234 33.3158 47.9922 40.048 47.9922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                  </svg></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="home-process-desc">
                                <p class="text-size-regular">Gain a comprehensive understanding of the business by analyzing its core operations, identifying current challenges it faces, and exploring potential opportunities for growth and improvement.</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Stakeholder Interviews</div>
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Diagnostic</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-number">01</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane">
                      <div class="home-process-pane">
                        <div class="home-process-media"><img src="/images/home-process-analyze.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home-process-analyze-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-analyze-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-analyze-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-analyze.webp 1098w" alt="Three consultants analysing research data together at a table" class="home-process-image" />
                          <div class="home-process-note"><img src="/images/home-process-avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-process-avatar" />
                            <div class="home-process-note-card">
                              <div class="home-process-note-label">Arcline working principle</div>
                              <p class="text-size-regular">“Every insight has to survive the numbers.”</p>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-panel">
                          <div class="home-process-body">
                            <div class="home-process-step">Step 02 · Weeks 3–5</div>
                            <div class="home-process-text-block">
                              <div class="home-process-title-row">
                                <h3 class="heading-style-3">Analyze</h3>
                                <div class="home-process-doodle w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 45 50" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M2 27C3.3557 18.4591 6.90298 10.3881 9 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M17.5 32C25.9926 27.1537 34.4984 22.3305 43 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M19.8228 47.1832C26.5813 47.234 33.3158 47.9922 40.048 47.9922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                  </svg></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="home-process-desc">
                                <p class="text-size-regular">Turn findings into insight. We model the numbers, map the customer journey and pressure-test every assumption so each option is grounded in evidence.</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Market Sizing</div>
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Data Modeling</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-number">02</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="w-tab-pane">
                      <div class="home-process-pane">
                        <div class="home-process-media"><img src="/images/home-process-strategize.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home-process-strategize-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-strategize-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-strategize-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-strategize.webp 1098w" alt="Consultant leading a strategy discussion with a leadership team at a whiteboard" class="home-process-image" />
                          <div class="home-process-note"><img src="/images/home-process-avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-process-avatar" />
                            <div class="home-process-note-card">
                              <div class="home-process-note-label">Arcline working principle</div>
                              <p class="text-size-regular">“A strategy is only as good as its first ninety days.”</p>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-panel">
                          <div class="home-process-body">
                            <div class="home-process-step">Step 03 · Weeks 6–9</div>
                            <div class="home-process-text-block">
                              <div class="home-process-title-row">
                                <h3 class="heading-style-3">Strategize</h3>
                                <div class="home-process-doodle w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 45 50" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M2 27C3.3557 18.4591 6.90298 10.3881 9 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M17.5 32C25.9926 27.1537 34.4984 22.3305 43 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M19.8228 47.1832C26.5813 47.234 33.3158 47.9922 40.048 47.9922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                  </svg></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="home-process-desc">
                                <p class="text-size-regular">Shape a clear plan with your leadership team: prioritized initiatives, a realistic roadmap and the business case needed to secure buy-in.</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Strategic Roadmap</div>
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Business Case</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-number">03</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="w-tab-pane">
                      <div class="home-process-pane">
                        <div class="home-process-media"><img src="/images/home-process-execute.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home-process-execute-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-execute-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-execute-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-execute.webp 1098w" alt="Colleagues talking through the rollout of a new plan" class="home-process-image" />
                          <div class="home-process-note"><img src="/images/home-process-avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-process-avatar" />
                            <div class="home-process-note-card">
                              <div class="home-process-note-label">Arcline working principle</div>
                              <p class="text-size-regular">“We measure success by what changes, not what we deliver.”</p>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-panel">
                          <div class="home-process-body">
                            <div class="home-process-step">Step 04 · Weeks 10–16</div>
                            <div class="home-process-text-block">
                              <div class="home-process-title-row">
                                <h3 class="heading-style-3">Execute</h3>
                                <div class="home-process-doodle w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 45 50" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M2 27C3.3557 18.4591 6.90298 10.3881 9 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M17.5 32C25.9926 27.1537 34.4984 22.3305 43 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                    <path d="M19.8228 47.1832C26.5813 47.234 33.3158 47.9922 40.048 47.9922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                  </svg></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="home-process-desc">
                                <p class="text-size-regular">Move from plan to results. We work alongside your teams, set up the operating rhythm and track the KPIs that prove the strategy is working.</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-process-chip">Implementation Support</div>
                              <div class="home-process-chip">KPI Tracking</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-process-number">04</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
